WEBVTT

00:05:01.663 --> 00:05:04.454
Now, more than a quarter of American
workers don't have

00:05:04.454 --> 00:05:06.829
a job that lifts them above
the poverty level.

00:05:07.496 --> 00:05:11.704
Millions of small businesses have
scaled back or closed entirely.

00:05:11.913 --> 00:05:14.621
A quarter of adults in
the US say that they

00:05:14.621 --> 00:05:18.913
or someone in their household was laid
off or lost their job because of

00:05:18.913 --> 00:05:23.913
the coronavirus outbreak, with 15 percent
saying it happened to them personally.

00:05:25.288 --> 00:05:29.704
And that is pretty much what Zig-Zag
project beta testers told me to.